# UTF-8 source files (mandatory)

All text source files in this repo **must be UTF-8 without BOM**. Never save or commit UTF-16 LE/BE (Windows "Unicode") — Next.js/SWC fails with `stream did not contain valid UTF-8` and Vercel builds break.

## When writing or editing files

- Use the Write/StrReplace tools or UTF-8 shell output — not PowerShell `-Encoding Unicode` or `Out-File -Encoding Unicode`.
- After editing on Windows, verify critical files start with ASCII bytes (e.g. `import` -> `69 6D 70 6F`), not `FF FE`.
- If recovering content from a UTF-16 blob, convert explicitly before committing.

## Applies to

`.ts`, `.tsx`, `.js`, `.jsx`, `.css`, `.json`, `.sql`, `.md`, and any other text committed to git — especially under `apps/web/src/`.

## Known past failure

`apps/web/src/lib/kundeportal-2/submit-ticket.ts` and `cases-api.ts` were once UTF-16 and broke `npm run build` on Vercel.